[
  {
    "text": "收藏了很多教程，\n动手时还是不会？",
    "startMs": 0,
    "endMs": 4000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "来一座学习农场：\n种下目标，练出能力。",
    "startMs": 4000,
    "endMs": 8000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "别只说“我要学 Excel”。\n先说最后想独立完成什么。",
    "startMs": 8000,
    "endMs": 12666.666666666668,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "比如：把农场的销售记录，\n整理成一张销售汇总表。",
    "startMs": 12666.666666666668,
    "endMs": 17333.333333333336,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "再告诉 AI：你会什么，\n每天能学多久。",
    "startMs": 17333.333333333336,
    "endMs": 22000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "实践者讲操作中的坑；\n怀疑者追问“凭什么”。",
    "startMs": 22000,
    "endMs": 26500,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "经济学家看钱流向哪里；\n历史学家找过去的例子。",
    "startMs": 26500,
    "endMs": 31000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "学者找研究证据。\n每个视角都要交代理由和来源。",
    "startMs": 31000,
    "endMs": 35500,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "这是 AI 模拟的五种视角，\n不是真有五位专家替你核实。",
    "startMs": 35500,
    "endMs": 40000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "有人说“先练”，\n有人说“先补基础”。",
    "startMs": 40000,
    "endMs": 44333.333333333336,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "让 AI 列出分歧、依据，\n以及什么证据能帮你判断。",
    "startMs": 44333.333333333336,
    "endMs": 48666.666666666664,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "大家都同意的结论，\n也不能直接当成事实。",
    "startMs": 48666.666666666664,
    "endMs": 53000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "把前面的资料压成简报：\n一句总结，几个关键发现。",
    "startMs": 53000,
    "endMs": 57000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "哪些有证据？哪些有争议？\n分别适用于什么情况？",
    "startMs": 57000,
    "endMs": 61000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "最后给一条行动：\n下一步，你具体要做什么？",
    "startMs": 61000,
    "endMs": 65000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "请 AI 挑出最没把握的结论，\n说明缺少什么证据。",
    "startMs": 65000,
    "endMs": 69000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "打开关键来源，\n看看它是否真的支持这句话。",
    "startMs": 69000,
    "endMs": 73000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "AI 给自己打九分，\n也不能代替真实核查。",
    "startMs": 73000,
    "endMs": 77000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "资料太多，就像背着种子\n一直逛，始终没下地。",
    "startMs": 77000,
    "endMs": 81333.33333333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "先选一份适合你的主资料，\n需要时再补，通常不超过五份。",
    "startMs": 81333.33333333333,
    "endMs": 85666.66666666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "每份都说明：学哪部分，\n怎么练，大约花多久。",
    "startMs": 85666.66666666667,
    "endMs": 90000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "把大目标拆成几个小阶段。\n先认字段，再计算，再汇总。",
    "startMs": 90000,
    "endMs": 94333.33333333333,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "每一级都有练习、常见错，\n以及“怎样才算会”的标准。",
    "startMs": 94333.33333333333,
    "endMs": 98666.66666666667,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "太难就退一步补基础，\n别靠硬撑假装跟上。",
    "startMs": 98666.66666666667,
    "endMs": 103000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "先练完成目标最需要的部分，\n尽快做出一个小结果。",
    "startMs": 103000,
    "endMs": 108000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "比如先算“销量乘单价”，\n再把不同商品的销售额汇总。",
    "startMs": 108000,
    "endMs": 113000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "“核心百分之二十”是取舍思路，\n不是固定效果，更不是速成保证。",
    "startMs": 113000,
    "endMs": 118000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "卖出三箱草莓，每箱二十元。\n销售额是多少？先自己想。",
    "startMs": 118000,
    "endMs": 122250,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "不要让 AI 连问题带答案，\n一次全部摆在你眼前。",
    "startMs": 122250,
    "endMs": 126500,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "你答完，它再指出哪里对、\n哪里错，必要时给一点提示。",
    "startMs": 126500,
    "endMs": 130750,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "纠错后换一道类似题，\n检查你是否真的理解了。",
    "startMs": 130750,
    "endMs": 135000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "为什么是“箱数乘单价”？\n用自己的话解释给小苗听。",
    "startMs": 135000,
    "endMs": 139666.66666666666,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "哪里含糊，AI 就补哪里，\n然后请你再讲一遍。",
    "startMs": 139666.66666666666,
    "endMs": 144333.33333333334,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "生活比喻帮你入门；\n准确的定义和边界也要讲清。",
    "startMs": 144333.33333333334,
    "endMs": 149000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "先自己回忆关键步骤，\n再让 AI 帮你补漏。",
    "startMs": 149000,
    "endMs": 153000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "压成一页速查表：\n定义、步骤、例子和常见错。",
    "startMs": 153000,
    "endMs": 157000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "它方便以后查阅，\n但笔记漂亮，不等于已经学会。",
    "startMs": 157000,
    "endMs": 161000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "换一份新的销售记录。\n这次，请 AI 先不要帮忙。",
    "startMs": 161000,
    "endMs": 165666.66666666666,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "自己算、自己汇总，\n再按事先说好的标准检查。",
    "startMs": 165666.66666666666,
    "endMs": 170333.33333333334,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "能独立做出新任务，\n才是比“我听懂了”更强的证据。",
    "startMs": 170333.33333333334,
    "endMs": 175000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "今天会了，不代表过几天还会。\n隔一段时间，再试一道新题。",
    "startMs": 175000,
    "endMs": 179666.66666666666,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "可以从第二天、几天后、\n一周后开始，按表现调整。",
    "startMs": 179666.66666666666,
    "endMs": 184333.33333333334,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "学得快不快，要看独立完成\n花多久，以及之后还会不会。",
    "startMs": 184333.33333333334,
    "endMs": 189000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "学一个公式或操作，\n不必每次先开“五角色大会”。",
    "startMs": 189000,
    "endMs": 193000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "目标、例子、自己练、纠错，\n再解释，再做新题。",
    "startMs": 193000,
    "endMs": 197000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "研究陌生行业时，\n再打开完整十步路线。",
    "startMs": 197000,
    "endMs": 201000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "暂停时，记下学到哪里、\n哪里还不会、下次练什么。",
    "startMs": 201000,
    "endMs": 206000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "把续学记录带到下次对话。\n换主题，也能重复用这套流程。",
    "startMs": 206000,
    "endMs": 211000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "多视角研究参考 STORM；\n练习测试和间隔复习参考学习研究。",
    "startMs": 211000,
    "endMs": 216000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "这些支持部分设计，\n没有证明整套流程能快十倍。",
    "startMs": 216000,
    "endMs": 221000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "用学习 Skill 带我学一个主题。\n说清基础、时间和独立任务。",
    "startMs": 221000,
    "endMs": 226500,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  },
  {
    "text": "让 AI 帮你找路，\n让自己的练习长出能力。",
    "startMs": 226500,
    "endMs": 232000,
    "timestampMs": null,
    "confidence": null
  }
]